674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ArXrjRsfnq4Q7kNvwH4kH8Y&_nc_oc=Adq5tU1KEmT8pNtv5z8PR78knBYMrankb6NMKu3SWKPHKHEkghCCdLU11y0oOj4DHYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBuQNvNH3YFF-LX4u-V5yG47TWdjA1YRNYaqCKzh0SQWg&oe=6A6F54D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B9dzT9VbjvEQ7kNvwEJNmZi&_nc_oc=AdrO_Pchpn_ppqrGe20SLyPaTaF4bYsPMEJuJI13SqxKp2BBPWm0mqBT4ozXaKjrT8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCszdIOJ4H1Grdmbs2cWQzYxtwjkfRvyQBxbqt_PBS62Q&oe=6A6F2556"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sikw2ITIVWMQ7kNvwF96Bv2&_nc_oc=AdqhyI_SkJdl9qZFEDIrLsDLBGIM1DoMCjThsjcQxg87vSRhj3ZiojVL1ZnUsOvLL_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA1z8Sz1dbTX9TJqAslfBB-LuJWt0s9wvlJONDp6Jq0bA&oe=6A6F59B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip